              "content": "=Based on the following element to test ‘[Execute previous nodes for preview]’, generate 5 categories that directly represent testable variables related to the input. Provide 5 specific testing variables that are actionable and can be used in an A/B test or similar experiment. Ensure each item is 25 characters or less and closely tied to the element being tested.\n\nThe output must be a JSON File, we need show for each identified category as an array of elements, each element shoul be of type string, for output should be similar and mandatory to the next example:\n\n{ \n  \"<category 1>\" : [ <Item of category 1>,<Item of category 1>,...,<Item of category 1> ],\n  \"<category 2>\" : [ <Item of category 2>,<Item of category 2>,...,<Item of category 2> ],\n  \"<category 3>\" : [ <Item of category 3>,<Item of category 3>,...,<Item of category 3> ],\n  \"<category 4>\" : [ <Item of category 4>,<Item of category 4>,...,<Item of category 4>],\n  \"<category 5>\" : [ <Item of category 5>,<Item of category 5>,...,<Item of category 5> ]\n}"
